    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27581" root="ظفر" body-key="Z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَظْفَرُ</span></b>  A man <i>having long nails:</i> (ISk, S, A:)
or <i>having long and broad nails:</i> (M, K:) and
in like manner applied to a <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنْسِم</span> [or foot of a
camel]: <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظَفْرَآءُ</span> [the reg. fem.] has not been heard.
(M.)

